  "nameAboutClassesHint": "Trademarks are registered per category (Nice class). For an assistant app, classes 9 and 42 are the primary ones; 35 and 38 may also apply depending on the features offered.",
  "nameAboutDisclaimerShort": "Informational only — NOT legal trademark clearance.",
  "nameAboutFaqAttorneyA": "Yes, before you register or rely on the name commercially. A search can miss similar marks, phonetic conflicts and prior rights that only a professional can assess. This app cannot give legal advice.",
  "nameAboutFaqAttorneyQ": "Do I really need a trademark attorney?",
  "nameAboutFaqChangeA": "Then it's better to learn that now. You can adjust the name, add a distinctive element, or choose a different class strategy with your attorney before investing further in the brand.",
  "nameAboutFaqChangeQ": "What if the name turns out to be taken?",
