  "nameAboutFaqClearedQ": "Is the name 'Assisto' legally cleared?",
  "nameAboutFaqGlobalA": "Trademarks are territorial. If you plan to launch in other countries, search the WIPO Global Brand Database and the relevant national offices (such as USPTO or EUIPO) as well.",
  "nameAboutFaqGlobalQ": "What about outside Bangladesh?",
