  "nameAboutFaqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
  "nameAboutFaqWhyClassesA": "Trademarks are registered by category. Class 9 covers software and mobile apps, and class 42 covers software-as-a-service and development — the two that matter most for an assistant app. Classes 35 and 38 may also apply for business or messaging features.",
