  "vehiclesTrackingComingSoon": "Assisto's own live vehicle tracking is coming soon. Until then, this guide helps you choose a tracker honestly — with no fake prices.",
  "vehiclesCompareTitle": "SIM GPS tracker vs Bluetooth tag",
  "vehiclesSimTitle": "SIM-card GPS tracker",
  "vehiclesSimHow": "How it works: a device with its own SIM uses GPS for location and mobile data to send it to a server, so you can see the vehicle live from anywhere.",
  "vehiclesSimCoverage": "Coverage: works anywhere there is mobile network — real-time tracking across the whole country.",
  "vehiclesSimBattery": "Battery: should be wired to the vehicle's power with a small backup battery, so it does not depend on charging.",
  "vehiclesSimLimit": "Limits: needs a small monthly data/SIM cost, and a thief can block it if they find and remove the device.",
  "vehiclesBtTitle": "Bluetooth tag",
  "vehiclesBtHow": "How it works: a small tag that your phone finds over Bluetooth when it is close by — it has no GPS of its own.",
  "vehiclesBtCoverage": "Coverage: only within a few metres of a phone. Some tags use other people's phones nearby, but that is unreliable for a vehicle.",
  "vehiclesBtBattery": "Battery: runs on a tiny coin-cell battery that lasts months, no wiring needed.",
  "vehiclesBtLimit": "Limits: it cannot track a stolen vehicle that drives away — good for finding a parked bike nearby, not anti-theft.",
  "vehiclesChecklistTitle": "What to look for in a tracker",
  "vehiclesCheckCutoff": "Engine cut-off relay — lets you remotely stop the engine (fit by a professional).",
  "vehiclesCheckBackupBattery": "Built-in backup battery — keeps tracking for a while even if the main power is cut.",
  "vehiclesCheckTamperAlert": "Tamper and power-cut alerts — warns you if someone unplugs or tampers with the device.",
  "vehiclesCheckGt06": "GT06 protocol support — so it can connect to Assisto's own tracking (coming soon).",
  "vehiclesCheckSimPlan": "A SIM with a small data plan — the tracker needs it to send its location.",
  "vehiclesInstallTitle": "Installation tips",
  "vehiclesInstallHidden": "Hide it well — place the device where a thief cannot easily find or reach it.",
  "vehiclesInstallPower": "Wire it to constant power with a backup battery, so it keeps working even if the main line is cut.",
